          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795017471407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Change the URL\n    GET /v1/employees/13\n  POST /v2/employees\n2. Custom Header\n    - X-Version: 2\n3. Content Negotiation\n    - Accept Header in a request.\n        - technically, you should be able to request a resource\n           in a variety of formats.\n4. Change the Authority\n5. Consumer/Provider\n    - I tell them what I want, they provide it.\n    - No conforming for me. I'm a rebel dottie, a loner.\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Change the URL\n    GET /v1/employees/13\n  POST /v2/employees\n2. Custom Header\n    - X-Version: 2\n3. Content Negotiation\n    - Accept Header in a request.\n        - technically, you should be able to request a resource\n           in a variety of formats.\n4. Change the Authority\n5. Consumer/Provider\n    - I tell them what I want, they provide it.\n    - No conforming for me. I'm a rebel dottie, a loner.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
